  "title": "Low-Fat Apple Spice Muffins",
  "description": "Whole grain pastry flour, egg whites, raw sugar, and a bouquet of warm spices give these apple muffins their lightness and naturally good taste. Bake up a batch in less than an hour.",
  "authors": [
    "Chef Ivy"
  ],
